    &gt;Using command redirection operators | Microsoft Docs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.robvanderwoude.com/redirection.php&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Batch files - Redirection&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
